For any closed convex cone $K\subseteq E_d:=\operatorname{Herm}_d(\mathbb C)$, let

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathsf A(K):\quad &X\in K,\ Y\in K^*,\ \langle X,Y\rangle=0,\\
&\operatorname{rank}(X-Y)=1
